        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 2930, 2-3/4\" Screen Door Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHalf Surface Single Acting Spring Hinge for Screen Doors. Door flange is surface applied to door. Jamb flange is mortised to door jamb.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer 2930 Screen Door Spring Hinge permit doors automatically return to the closed position (Self Closing). \r\nPackaged  with #7 x 3/4\" wood mounting screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe included Tension Tool is use to adjust spring tension. The Locking Pins hold the Spring in tension after it is set. These adjustable tension spring hinges allow you to determine how much closing force you apply to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Bommer 2930 Screen Door Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Size: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Tension</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Half Surface</li>\r\n<li>Door flange surface applied</li>\r\n<li>Jamb flange mortise to jamb</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/2930.pdf?v=1691094994\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 2930 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges).</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/screen-door-hardware\">Screen Door Hardware</a>.</b>\r\n<br><br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
